1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Daniel: Nervous about your audition, Maya?

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:07,500
Maya: A little. I've got butterflies in my stomach.

3
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:10,500
Daniel: You've worked hard. Break a leg!

4
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:14,000
Maya: Thanks. I'll give it my best shot.

5
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:17,800
Daniel: And don't let one bad audition get under your skin.

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,500
Maya: You're right. It's not the end of the world.

7
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Daniel: By the way, did you tell anyone about the surprise party?

8
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:29,500
Maya: Of course not. My lips are sealed.
